        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 26 at 2:19PM EDT until September 27 at 8:00PM EDT by NWS Gray ME</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northeast winds 20 to 30 kt with gusts up to 45 kt and
seas 9 to 14 ft.

* WHERE...Waters from Stonington ME to Port Clyde ME from 25 to
60 NM, Waters from Port Clyde ME to Cape Elizabeth ME from 25
to 60 NM and Waters from Cape Elizabeth ME to Merrimack River
MA from 25 to 60 NM.

* WHEN...Until 8 PM EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Strong winds will cause hazardous seas which could
capsize or damage vessels and reduce visibility.
</description>
        <instruction>Mariners should alter plans to avoid these hazardous conditions.
Remain in port, seek safe harbor, alter course, and/or secure the
vessel for severe conditions.</instruction>
